        "page_index": 0,
        "reading_text": "Quarterly Review: Larkspur Community Grants Program\n1. Summary\nThe grants program closed its third quarter with a full pipeline and a modest surplus. Overall demand\nstayed close to the forecast prepared in April, and the committee approved every award on the schedule\npublished in June.\n2. Grant activity\nActivity was steady through the quarter. Two review panels met twice each, and the second panel\ncleared the backlog of appeals that had accumulated since the spring cycle.\nApplications received 118\nAwards approved 42\nMedian award (USD) 4,250\nSuccess rate 36%\nUncommitted balance 11,300\nLarkspur grants quarterly review - synthetic fixture Page 1 of 2",
