        "page_index": 1,
        "reading_text": "3. Observations\nThe committee observed that smaller grants were processed faster\nthan large ones, mostly because large applications required an\nexternal assess-\nment before the panel could vote. That step adds roughly three\nweeks to the timetable and should be scheduled in advance.\n4. Recommended actions\nThe panel recommends appointing a second assessor for the winter cycle and publishing the\nassessment criteria with the application form.\nNote 1: The success rate counts withdrawn applications as received but not assessed. Figures cover 1 July to 30\nSeptember 2026.\nLarkspur grants quarterly review - synthetic fixture Page 2 of 2",
